    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Churches are delighted to present to market No. 4 Broomfield Hall, a tastefully decorated and superbly finished first floor apartment with two balconies and views over trees and greenery. \r\n\r\nThis apartment features a welcoming central hallway with built-in storage closets leading to two double bedrooms. The spacious primary bedroom benefits from a large window and expansive floor-to-ceiling fitted wardrobes. The second double bedroom also includes built-in wardrobes and opens directly onto one of two generous balconies. Serving both bedrooms, the fully tiled main bathroom is in excellent condition and fitted with a shower-over-bath combination.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is a bright, open-plan living area featuring a focal fireplace and double glass doors that open onto the second balcony offering serene greenery views. Intelligently integrated into this space is a dedicated dining area adjacent to a fully fitted modern kitchen equipped with ample cabinetry and generous worktop space.\r\n\r\nBroomfield Hall itself is a highly regarded and private gated development quietly hidden off Shanganagh Road. Only a brisk walk away from Shankill village and all of its associated amenities such as boutique shops, cafes, pubs, Tesco Express and Centra. Closer to the development is a Lidl, Costa Cafe and a pharmacy. Shankill and Killiney beaches are also just a stroll away.\r\n\r\nTransport links include the N11 dual carriageway offering ease of access to the city and the south along with the M50 interchange a few minutes away. Shankill DART only a short walk away (10min), numerous Dublin bus routes to the city centre as well as the Aircoach for direct access to the airport are all close to hand.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall:      c.   4.6 x 2.4m\r\n\r\n\r\nLiving Room:      c.  4.71 x 3.80m\r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen:     c.   2.13 x 3.80m\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1:     c.   3.66 x 3.20m\t\t\t\t\t\t (to rear)\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2:     c.   4.80 x 2.12m\t\t\t\t\t\t  (to front)\r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom:       c.    2.14 x 2.17m"
      },
      {
